        "description": "<p>A modern take on a traditional Japanese oribe glaze, AMACO PC-15 Satin Oribe adds a wonderful blue-green burnished look to your wares. Over texture, the dark green pools and light grey breaks bring an extra level of depth to this opaque glaze. For best results, apply the glazes from the AMACO Potter's Choice series in 2-3 layers on your bisque-fired ware. You can layer the glazes from this series with each other in countless combinations, to achieve unique, floating effects.</p>",
